# Code navigation: no single tool's reference list is complete

Neither codegraph nor a language server is complete on "who references this", and both fail silently. Before a rename, a deletion, a signature change, or any edit whose correctness depends on finding every caller, invoke `reference-coverage`, confirm the list against a second independent source, and say which tool produced each claim.
